          ],
          "value": "Phosphorylation at Thr-283 by MAP kinases is required for ubiquitination and degradation by the DCX(AMBRA1) complex"
        }
      ],
      "commentType": "PTM"
    },
    {
      "texts": [
        {
          "evidences": [
