              "id": "33854232"
            },
            {
              "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
              "source": "PubMed",
              "id": "33854235"
            }
          ],
          "value": "Ubiquitinated by the DCX(AMBRA1) complex during the transition from G1 to S cell phase, leading to its degradation: ubiquitination is dependent on Thr-283 phosphorylation (PubMed:33854232, PubMed:33854235). The DCX(AMBRA1) complex represents the major regulator of CCND3 stability during the G1/S transition (PubMed:33854232, PubMed:33854235). Polyubiquitinated by the SCF(FBXL2) complex, leading to proteasomal degradation (By similarity)"
        }
      ],
